    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W1 — Multi-Label Gmail to Sheets and Drive\nSETUP: 1) Connect Gmail / Sheets / Drive OAuth. 2) Edit Config node (labels, Sheet ID, Drive ROOT folder ID — create folder PDS_Gmail_Attachments first). 3) Create Gmail label PDS/Processed. 4) Create Sheet tabs Emails / Attachments / Errors (see docs/SHEETS_SCHEMA.md). 5) Activate.\nFLOW: Schedule(15m) -> ONE Gmail query for ALL labels (excludes PDS/Processed; Gmail node Simple=FALSE so raw headers/labelIds/attachments arrive) -> extract sender/date/label -> dedupe by message_id (Sheets read) -> UPSERT email row -> if attachments: Prepare Attachment Work re-attaches binaries from the original Extract output via pairedItem (Sheets nodes drop binaries) -> folder loop (Label/Date/SenderName, search-then-create per level, batchSize 1) AND the attachment items both feed the Merge (input 0 = attachments, input 1 = loop-done) -> join folder ids -> upload with ORIGINAL filename -> upsert attachment row (message_id+filename) -> label PDS/Processed.\nRETRY: only fully-handled mail gets PDS/Processed; failures land in Errors tab and are retried next poll; Sheets upserts make retries row-safe. Timezone Asia/Manila in workflow settings.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 1140,
        "color": 4
      },
